sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Guest as Khach vang lai (Guest)
    participant UI as React Web App
    participant Ctrl as AuthController
    participant Svc as AuthService
    participant Token as JwtTokenService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL (ApplicationDbContext)

    Guest->>+UI: 1. Nhap thong tin dang ky (Username, Email, Password, FullName, PhoneNumber)
    UI->>+Ctrl: 2. POST /api/v1/auth/register (RegisterUserRequestDto)
    Ctrl->>+Svc: 3. RegisterUserAsync(request, ct)
    Svc->>+DB: 4. SELECT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM users WHERE LOWER(email) = @email OR LOWER(username) = @user)
    
    alt Trung Email hoac Username (Vi pham BR-AUTH-01)
        DB-->>Svc: 5a. Return true (Da ton tai)
        Svc-->>Ctrl: 6a. Throw BusinessRuleException ("BR-AUTH-01", "MSG-AUTH-01")
        Ctrl-->>UI: 7a. 400 Bad Request: ApiResponse (MSG-AUTH-01)
        UI-->>Guest: 8a. Hien thi canh bao Email hoac Username da duoc su dung
    else Thong tin hop le & duy nhat
        DB-->>-Svc: 5b. Return false
        Note over Svc: 1. Bam mat khau BCrypt.HashPassword()<br/>2. Khoi tao User (Role = Citizen, Status = Active - BR-AUTH-02)<br/>3. Khoi tao UserEcoProfile (TreeLevel = 1, CurrentGreenPoints = 0)
        Svc->>+DB: 6b. INSERT INTO users & INSERT INTO UserEcoProfiles
        DB-->>-Svc: 7b. 2 rows affected
        
        Svc->>+Token: 8b. GenerateAccessToken(user) & GenerateRefreshToken()
        Token-->>-Svc: 9b. Return JWT AccessToken (30m) + (rawRefreshToken, refreshTokenHash)
        
        Svc->>+DB: 10b. INSERT INTO refresh_tokens (user_id, token_hash, expires_at)
        DB-->>-Svc: 11b. 1 row affected
        
        Svc-->>-Ctrl: 12b. Return AuthResponseDto (User.Role = "Citizen")
        Ctrl-->>-UI: 13b. 201 Created: ApiResponse<AuthResponseDto> (MSG-AUTH-08)
        UI-->>-Guest: 14b. Chuyen tu Guest -> User (Citizen) & Dieu huong vao Trang chu
    end
